s; white-space: nowrap;">lib.md</span><span style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 12px; color: var(--neutral-600); flex-shrink: 0;">MD</span></div></a></div></div><div data-testid="bubble" data-hide-actions="false">see files</div></div></div>"`;
